  _category: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67eb6452bf5f2224083042268f30f622, type: 2}
  _glyph: "\U0001F4E6\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: Does Lore data bloat my game build?
  _description: 'The Lore window and all editor tools never end up in a build. A
    build only contains Lore data that a scene references: a LoreProject reference
    brings in all Entries, a single Entry reference only that Entry. Entries themselves
    are mostly text and small.


    What can get big are the assets field values
    point to (Sprites, prefabs, audio clips): they load together with the Entry.
    Reference the Project only where you need lookups, and single Entries elsewhere.
    Details: "Memory & loading" in Documentation~/RuntimeAPI.md.'
  _sortOrder: 9
